<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Brambles</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: Druid (guild level 12)
Mana: 30
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast brambles</a>
</pre>
<p>The druid holds out a hand and wiggles their fingers, and a large clump 
of thorny bushes grows from the ground. Whoever moves or acts in the room 
risks being stuck by the thorns, for 3 to 17 hit points each time; a nimble 
character dodges them more often. The thorns don't spare anyone: the druid 
and their friends get stuck as well.
</p><p>The bush lives from half a minute to a couple of minutes, longer the better 
your spell, then withers away. Every time the thorns stick someone, their 
weight presses on it, and heavy creatures soon crush it flat.
</p><p>It only grows outside on open ground: not indoors, not on water, snow or 
ice. You must be standing. It is also found on wands, staffs and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hedge Wall</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>